<title>HONG KONG: HK trade grew estimated five pct in 1996--gov't.</title>
<headline>HK trade grew estimated five pct in 1996--gov't.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's trade in goods and services grew an estimated five percent in 1996, Director General of Trade Alan Lai told a news conference on Monday.</p>
</text>
